00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:41.770
Ronja enjoyed soaking up the spring with Birk in the forest,

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:47.550
but when she returned to the castle, she found Sturkus badly injured.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:52.190
She learned he had caught an arrow during the scuffle with Borka's robbers.

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:54.150
This is only the beginning!

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:59.200
I'll crush each one of them in turn!

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:05.280
The Endless Dispute (Part 1)

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:05.280
The Endless Dispute (Part 1)

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:17.100
All right.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.700
Mother...

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.350
It's okay.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.220
Uh-huh.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.130
Relax.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.710
Looking good, Sturkus.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:48.720
Your wound's already closed up.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.380
That's our guy!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.680
Sturkus!

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:32.820
Sorry to make you worry.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.680
I'm fine now.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.850
Have you healed already?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:45.560
I'm still a bit weak in the legs, but otherwise quite spry.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:46.430
Right?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.630
Yup.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.310
Wow!

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.370
Nice, Sturkus!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.420
Don't trip and fall!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.880
Sturkus was able to get up after four days.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.840
Contrary to Ronja's expectations,

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:16.660
Mattis and Borka's conflict had flared up and grown dangerous.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:36.740
One, two, three, four...

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:43.840
Thank goodness... Everyone came back safely.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.650
Hey, Dad.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:19.000
Why must you and Borka be out for each others' blood?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.430
Ask Borka.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.670
He shot the first arrow.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.480
Sturkus can tell you that.

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.660
The child has more sense than you have, Mattis.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:41.410
If this keeps up, it can only end in bloodshed and misery.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:44.690
What good would that do?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.070
What good would it do?!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.670
That should be obvious!

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:58.710
It would get Borka out of Mattis' Wood at last!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.470
Don't you understand that, you fools?!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:11.490
And does it have to be done by bloodshed, so that everyone is dead before you give in?

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.380
Is there no other way?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:21.490
<i>You</i> find another way then, since you're so clever.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:25.140
You get Borka out of Mattis' Fort.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:29.200
Then he can settle down as peaceful as fox crap in the forest,

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:32.470
and all his thieving hounds with him.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:37.000
Then I wouldn't lay another hand on them!

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:44.120
But if I'm not allowed to kill Borka at least...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.720
I'll be known as a coward among robbers.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.980
Listen, you guys!

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.440
If you see Borka, beat him up without hesitation!

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.820
Yeah!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:18.330
Let's go!

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.070
Birk.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.840
Hi!

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:56.210
Even springtime has been ruined for us...

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:04.550
Thanks to a couple of bad tempered old robber chieftains with no sense.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.940
If I didn't have you as a brother,

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:25.910
I don't know, but if I didn't have you...

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:36.790
I might not mind that Mattis wants to do away with Borka.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:47.440
So it's your fault that I have so many worries,

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:48.760
Birk Borkason!

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:53.270
I don't want you to have to worry.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:57.270
But it's hard for me too.

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:06.090
Not knowing who's dead or who's alive until evening comes...

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.820
it makes me uneasy.

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:11.540
No one has died yet though.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:19.990
But that's only because the Sheriff's men have started swarming through the woods again.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:37.320
Mattis and Borka simply haven't had a chance to kill each other.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.050
Dammit.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.780
They have their hands full keeping away from the law.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.520
Dammit.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.750
So far they've both been lucky.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:59.380
Imagine that! The Sheriff's men being useful.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.910
Who would have expected that?

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:21.680
All the same, it's something to worry about.

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.980
You are beasts.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:04.440
No matter how good-natured you may look at the moment.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:23.100
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:26.440
Yeah, see you tomorrow.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:51.190
Will I ever again rejoice in the forest like before?

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:03.670
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:03.670
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.610
Ronja!

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:32.530
Hurry home and see what's happened!

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:33.200
Yeah.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.580
It must be something pleasant,

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:40.950
I can tell from your faces.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:43.420
Oh yes! You're right there!

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.960
Go and see for yourself!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:47.620
Yeah.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.050
Okay!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.680
Hurry!

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.450
Ronja!

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.380
I'm home!

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:42.380
Oh, my Ronja!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.890
You were right!

00:15:57.610 --> 00:16:00.880
We don't have to shed blood at all!

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:04.380
Now Borka will go to blazes

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.790
quicker than his first fart of the morning!

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.300
Believe me!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.260
How so?

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.480
Look there.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:21.040
Look who I've just caught with my own hands.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.480
Listen, my Ronja.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:29.380
I only have to say to Borka:

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:33.850
Are you staying?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:36.570
Or will you be going?

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:40.570
Well, Borka, do you want your devilspawn back?

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:43.130
Or don't you?

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.270
So there!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:04.680
Hey there, little Borkason. When are you going home to your father?

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.560
You can't do such a thing...

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:49.890
You can't do this!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.240
You monster!

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:55.880
You can't do something like this!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.780
Not like this!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.390
You can't do such a thing?

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:09.720
What's that my daughter says I can't do?

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:14.840
I'll tell you!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:21.340
You can go steal all the money, and goods, and junk you want!

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:24.450
But... But...

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:27.490
You can't steal people!

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:32.780
Because if you do, I...

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:35.520
I don't want to be your daughter anymore!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:40.970
Who's talking about people?

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:45.550
I merely captured a snake slithering around the castle.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.400
Just a louse,

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.350
a little thieving hound.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:57.550
Finally, I'm going to clean out my father's fortress at last.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:06.460
Then you can be my daughter or not, just as you choose.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.710
I don't like you!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.020
I hate you!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:16.600
Ronja! That's no way to talk to your father.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.230
I really hate you!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.010
Fjosok...

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.150
Y-Yes—?

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.380
Send a message to Borka.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:35.950
Tell him I want to see him at Hell's Gap come sunrise tomorrow morning.

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:41.420
It would be safer for him to come, tell him that!

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:42.920
Y-Yes.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.720
Don't you lay a hand on the devilspawn!

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.080
Devilspawn or no,

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:01.860
this wound must be cleansed.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:17.980
Mom!

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.670
Why me?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.320
What good are you men?

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:36.000
I'm sick of all of you!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.230
You never do anything but make trouble!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:41.690
Do you hear me, Mattis?!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.730
What the hell are you doing?!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.520
Birk!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.930
I really hate you!

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.930
Mattis!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:42.210
Mattis did not lie in his usual bed beside Lovis that night.

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:48.190
And where he slept, even Lovis did not know.

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:59.230
Now I can lay any way I want across the bed.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:16.330
Don't come in.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:30.190
Ronja lay awake a long time,

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:37.850
hating her father until she felt her heart clench with pain.

00:22:56.510 --> 00:23:03.720
But it's difficult to hate someone who you have loved so much all your life,

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:11.310
and that was why this was the heaviest of nights for Ronja.

